  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "755f4dda-d5d0-40d3-b03d-d3da634915fa",
      "question": "Among the 500 most liquid US stocks, which 10 had the strongest and which 10 the weakest returns from July 1 through December 31, 2025, and how volatile was each one's daily trading?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T18:53:54.981561Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T18:54:10.880061Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 10 strongest returns (July 1 – December 31, 2025, among the 500 most liquid US stocks)**\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Return | Daily Volatility (σ) |\n|------|--------|--------|----------------------|\n| 1 | ABVX | +1,662.81% | 51.79% |\n| 2 | ARWR | +320.19% | 4.60% |\n| 3 | BE | +261.62% | 6.94% |\n| 4 | CIFR | +209.40% | 7.16% |\n| 5 | CIEN | +187.56% | 3.59% |\n| 6 | AEO | +174.12% | 5.15% |\n| 7 | APLD | +145.25% | 6.59% |\n| 8 | MU | +131.61% | 3.53% |\n| 9 | ALB | +125.69% | 3.96% |\n| 10 | BTU | +121.31% | 3.84% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Top 10 weakest returns (same window, same universe)**\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Return | Daily Volatility (σ) |\n|------|--------|--------|----------------------|\n| 1 | ASST | -80.15% | 12.20% |\n| 2 | ALIT | -65.64% | 3.08% |\n| 3 | AEVA | -64.86% | 6.96% |\n| 4 | CBRL | -58.42% | 3.14% |\n| 5 | CRWV | -56.14% | 6.04% |\n| 6 | CRCL | -56.14% | 5.56% |\n| 7 | CCOI | -55.28% | 5.18% |\n| 8 | BRBR | -53.86% | 4.02% |\n| 9 | CORT | -52.59% | 5.41% |\n| 10 | ACVA | -50.55% | 4.72% |\n\n[2]\n\n**Notes**\n- Returns are total adjusted-close returns from the close before July 1, 2025 to the close on December 31, 2025.\n- Volatility is the standard deviation of daily returns over the same window (shown as a percentage).\n- Each observation covers 128 trading sessions (full coverage for 9 of the 10 laggards; CRWV and CRCL had 127 sessions, 99.2% coverage).\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — market scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:d1433d1dcc6d58edeaf021aa57cba47b52772f9f2128d0dde8822b9c08663cca`\n- [2] Market analytics result — market scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:a7fb8c7e934ac4ee00791d95263a88a3dbd18064aa07d9b8ca6e9cdd30087bb3`",
